This obfuscated JavaScript function, `uniqueCharacters`, checks whether all characters (or elements) in a given string or array are **unique** (i.e., no duplicates exist). It returns `true` if all elements are distinct, and `false` if any duplicate is found.

## Deobfuscated Version

