function uniqueCharacters(input) {
  for (let i = 0; i < input.length; i++) {
    for (let j = i + 1; j < input.length; j++) {
      if (input[i] === input[j]) {
        return false;
      }
    }
  }
  return true;
}
```

## How It Works

1. **Outer loop (`i`)**: Iterates through each character/element in the input.
2. **Inner loop (`j`)**: Compares the current element (`i`) with every subsequent element (starting from `i + 1`) to the end of the input.
